<title>USA: U.S. DAP prices steady-weak, ammonia steady.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP prices steady-weak, ammonia steady.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diammonium phosphate prices were steady to weak, pressured by waning domestic demand, dealers said. DAP exports to China and India were sufficient to underpin prices, dealers said. Anhydrous ammonia values were mostly steady.</p>
<p>				   Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Monday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		172		     unc-dn $2.00</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  185-187		 unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		160		     unc</p>
<p>(na - not available, nc - no comparison)</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
